WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.054 --> 00:00:24.663
"Fish!" Jeremy cried.

2
00:00:24.663 --> 00:00:28.304
"Finally!" Tom said.

3
00:00:28.304 --> 00:00:30.212
He was happy.

4
00:00:30.213 --> 00:00:34.087
Soon they could look for the flowers!

5
00:00:34.087 --> 00:00:36.953
Bump! Bump!

6
00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:39.407
Tom looked at the water.

7
00:00:39.408 --> 00:00:43.338
Small fish swam all around the boat.

8
00:00:43.338 --> 00:00:47.425
"They are minnows," Jeremy said.

9
00:00:47.425 --> 00:00:51.452
Tom did not have a fishing rod.

10
00:00:51.453 --> 00:00:55.840
But he had a paw.

11
00:00:55.840 --> 00:01:02.718
He swatted at the water.

12
00:01:02.718 --> 00:01:06.282
"No, Tom!" Jeremy said.

13
00:01:06.282 --> 00:01:09.199
"You will scare away all the fish."

14
00:01:09.199 --> 00:01:14.356
Tom frowned.

15
00:01:14.357 --> 00:01:22.161
Suddenly something pulled on Jeremy's rod.

16
00:01:22.161 --> 00:01:27.993
"Help!" Jeremy cried.

17
00:01:27.994 --> 00:01:32.382
Jeremy pulled hard on the rod.

18
00:01:32.383 --> 00:01:39.085
Tom pulled too.

19
00:01:39.085 --> 00:01:46.138
But the fish was very strong.

20
00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:49.453
"Ahh!" Tom cried.

21
00:01:49.454 --> 00:01:52.106
He almost slipped off the boat.

22
00:01:52.106 --> 00:01:58.049
Tom was getting tired.

23
00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.590
He wanted to rest.

24
00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:04.703
"One more time," Jeremy said.

25
00:02:04.704 --> 00:02:10.643
"Let's pull!"

26
00:02:10.644 --> 00:02:18.590
Tom and Jeremy pulled hard on the rod.

27
00:02:18.591 --> 00:02:24.356
Splash! Finally the fish popped out of the water.

28
00:02:24.357 --> 00:02:27.579
But it was not a minnow.

29
00:02:27.579 --> 00:02:31.183
This fish was shiny.

30
00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:33.959
It had sharp teeth.

31
00:02:33.959 --> 00:02:42.303
"It's a giant trout!" Jeremy yelled.
